files.description:
1) users.csv: contains general information about the participants, such as:
- Id: automatic generated identifier;
- Age: age group of the participant (1: "8-25", 2: "26-35", 3: "36-45", 4: "46-55", 5: ">55", 6: "prefer not to say");
- Gender: self-identified gender of the participant (1: "male", 2: "female", 3: "other", 4: "prefer not to say");
- Duration: duration (in seconds) of the experiment session;
- Passed_checks: number of passed attention checks (the maximum is 4);
- Feedback: general feedback provided at the end of the experiment;

